<item>
<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-15T23:44:51.846Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:44:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have launched air strikes on gold mining sites near the Sudan-Egypt border, killing dozens of miners, while the Rapid Support Forces used a paramilitary drone to strike near the Ethiopian frontier, causing civilian casualties in West Kordofan. In the Blue Nile, the Sudanese army repelled a joint RSF and SPLM-N attack, inflicting heavy losses on the attackers. Doctors in Sudan report worsening detention conditions for more than 6,500 people held by the RSF. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168577&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQU2VONDlQSmpCSUpDeFlBb1FkTnM4OXlDeG5KekdUcVptQWtJT2kxaVhHaTl3WVY4U1J5YXphejJhODk1NWxaZEYzcDd6NHVyTmg2UUxYa1BjNmltM0pKTG9BU0Ezd2NqRm9GcFdGOHJROGhXdmFVVUdzNlJ5ck9veVJHR0V1dF9uU3hyNnc1Q080a0psY3BicE5OeEQ5SHlRZnZhZ1lkQUoxeUlpRVZKQUZ0dWRMSEhh?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5ldnVNZ0ZCX2F6NVlDZHV3Z3J5OEF5WXY3Rl9HMHBBSnlicVA3RnkwVFJpN1NNWjZGaHhpTXMyUTM0MGJTUEs3VUVlRXZfejI5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5sdXVWMVkwaXo4YnJfYW82S2ZLR3FfRzZsTDA4UVpPd01yYTNrU29Db1VHQzhuRWZpMDFIN0xoZkN6MVh5dy1CaFNUZnVoajli?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1hR01WMzJEYUJqa0NBaUZDaVFBVS0wNEVkTmZqeUVDU1k5NlF2LWRqQ182aVloaTlLSU5KV2xremZLa2tQLThTaXJlal82ZmFz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article